## Critical Notes
<critical>
- ALWAYS validate account indices before access
- NEVER assume account presence without checks
- Validate program IDs before execution
- Handle CPI context correctly
- Track all account permissions
- Maintain instruction ordering
- Include block height in context
</critical> 